<title>NIGERIA: Nigerian Ashaka Cement Q3 profits higher.</title>
<headline>Nigerian Ashaka Cement Q3 profits higher.</headline>
<dateline>LAGOS 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Third quarter results for Ashaka Cement Nigeria Plc to end-August 1996.</p>
<p>(In million naira).</p>
<p>				 1996	   1995</p>
<p> Turnover		   2,734  vs   2,503</p>
<p> Profit before taxation   647  vs     568</p>
<p> Taxation		     182  vs     184</p>
<p> Profit after taxation    464  vs     384</p>
<p>($1=80 naira)</p>
<p>-- Lagos newsroom +234 1 263 03 17</p>
</text>
